      "value": "this should be re-opened as the issue it raises is still present\n\nwhen in red status/do not disturb you can currently send a request to join someone else, but you will cannot receive any response, this a quiet failure and there is no indication to the user what's happening\n\nthe client should disable sending a request when in red status/do not disturb and explain why, or responses to requests sent out should be shown as an exception",
